    {
      "id": "p0188-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Early on, Toby noted that \"Alphys\" should be pronounced \"al-feez\", which he imagined would be spelled in Japanese as アルフィーズ (arufīzu). He also understood that this six-character name could cause problems with Papyrus’ vertical text box, which only comfortably allows five characters per line. Thus, per Toby’s personal suggestion, Alphys is now known as アルフィー (arufī, roughly: \"Alphy\") in the Japanese script. Naturally, this name change surprised early Japanese fans who were accustomed to seeing Alphys’ full name in the fan-made translations.",
        "raw": "Early on, Toby noted that \"Alphys\" should be pronounced \"al-feez\", which\nhe imagined would be spelled in Japanese as 7 1v71- A' (arnfizu). He also\nunderstood that this six-character name could cause problems with Papyrus'\nvertical text box, which only comfortably allows five characters per line. Thus,\nper Toby's personal suggestion, Al phys is now known as 7 1v71- (arufi,\nroughly: \"Alphy\") in the Japanese script. Naturally, this name change surprised\nearly Japanese fans who were accustomed to seeing Al phys' full name in the\nfan-made translations.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en",
          "ja"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29279592,
          0.35418571,
          0.89638776,
          0.49345
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2897551,
          0.35347143,
          0.89842857,
          0.49452143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          24,
          27,
          29,
          31,
          33,
          35,
          37,
          38
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Toby 很早就说明，“Alphys”应读作“al-feez”，他设想的日文写法是「アルフィーズ」（arufīzu）。他也明白，这个六字符的名字可能不适合 Papyrus 的竖排对话框，因为那里每行只能轻松容纳五个字符。因此，按照 Toby 本人的建议，日文剧本采用了「アルフィー」（arufī，大致相当于“Alphy”）。早期日本玩家已习惯民间译版中的完整名字，看到改名自然很吃惊。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 57,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          },
