    {
      "id": "p0188-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "A killer robot named Mettaton appears and repeatedly attempts to stop the main character in unusual ways. In English, Mettaton usually speaks like a game show host. He speaks similarly in Japanese, and usually uses the boyish pronoun boku to refer to himself.",
        "raw": "A killer robot named Mettaton appears and repeatedly attempts to stop the\nmain character in unusual ways. In English, Mettaton usually speaks like a\ngame show host. He speaks similarly in Japanese, and usually uses the boyish\npronoun boku to refer to himself.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
